{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/fodpleje_69f1d9e0-5c29-440b-bd51-ef156c023126.jpg","label":"Fødder","subheading":"","icon":"none","icon_width":32,"mobile_icon_width":24,"title":"Fødder","price":"","heading_tag":"h3","price_heading_tag":"h4","highlight_effect":"marker","content":"<ul><li>**Shellac på tæerne helfarve: 375 kr.<\/li><li>**Shellac på tæerne helfarve inkl. aftagning: 475 kr.<\/li><li>**Shellac på tæerne m. fransk kant: 425 kr.<\/li><li>**Shellac på tæerne m. fransk kant inkl. aftagning: 525 kr.<\/li><li>**Aftagning af shellac: 100 kr.<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Ekstra holdbar UV lak der holder 6 – 8 uger. Book gerne en Del fodbehandling hvis du ønsker negle og neglebånd ordnet inden lakering.<\/p>","button_label":"Book behandling","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/booking","button_style":"solid"}},"item_xTxdmp":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Handpleje.jpg","label":"Hænder","subheading":"","icon":"none","icon_width":32,"mobile_icon_width":24,"title":"Hænder","price":"","heading_tag":"h3","price_heading_tag":"h4","highlight_effect":"marker","content":"<ul><li>**Shellac på hænder helfarve: 375 kr.<\/li><li>**Shellac på hænder helfarve inkl. aftagning: 475 kr.<\/li><li>**Shellac på hænder m. fransk kant: 425 kr.<\/li><li>**Shellac på hænder m. fransk kant inkl. aftagning: 525 kr.<\/li><li>**Aftagning af shellac: 100 kr.<\/li><li>**Rep af shellac negl: 50 kr.<\/li><li>**Reparation af gele negl: 95 kr.<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Ekstra holdbar UV lak der holder 10 – 14 dage. Book gerne en mini manicure hvis du ønsker negle og neglebånd ordnet inden lakering.<\/p>","button_label":"Book behandling","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/booking","button_style":"solid"}}},"block_order":["item_jTCk6n","item_xTxdmp"],"name":"t:sections.timeline.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-4","timeline_position":"top","image_position":"right","text_alignment":"left","add_image_spacing":true}},"press_AUTUHM":{"type":"press","blocks":{"item_DtBVFq":{"type":"item","settings":{"logo_width":80,"author":"Charlotte","content":"Jeg nyder altid mine timer hos Højholt i Silkeborg, det er rart, trygt og de er professionelle."}},"item_ipAJiC":{"type":"item","settings":{"logo_width":80,"author":"Astrid","content":"En time i spahimlen. Kan anbefale alle at forkæle sig selv med et besøg hos Højholt."}},"item_ePM7yq":{"type":"item","settings":{"logo_width":80,"author":"Rebekka","content":"Dygtige og kompetente hænder gennem hele behandlingen. En meget fin oplevelse- som altid."}}},"block_order":["item_DtBVFq","item_ipAJiC","item_ePM7yq"],"name":"t:sections.press.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","title":"","use_arrows_navigation":false,"show_quotation_mark":true,"quotation_tag":"h3","item_style":"avatar","autoplay":true,"cycle_speed":6,"overlay_color":"#000000","overlay_opacity":20}},"text_with_media_qxYb7W":{"type":"text-with-media","blocks":{"subheading_yFjxWd":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":"Hvem er jeg","position":"top_left"}},"heading_FTwWdL":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Annette Nørgaard","heading_tag":"h1","position":"top_left","highlight_effect":"default","highlight_accent_color":"","highlight_text_color":""}},"richtext_TbxKnM":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"text":"<p>Jeg, Annette Nørgaard, byder dig hjerteligt velkommen hos Højholt Hudpleje i Silkeborg. Jeg er uddannet lægeeksamineret fodbehandler og negletekniker og har siden 2010 arbejdet med stor passion for at skabe sunde fødder og velplejede negle.<\/p><p>Siden 2019 har jeg haft min faste base som selvstændig behandler i de hyggelige og professionelle rammer hos Højholt Hudpleje på Nygade 7A i hjertet af Silkeborg. Her tilbyder jeg fagligt funderede behandlinger med fokus på både velvære, sundhed og æstetik – altid med udgangspunkt i dine behov.<\/p><p>Jeg glæder mig til at tage imod dig og give dig en tryg og professionel oplevelse, hvor du og dine fødder er i centrum.<\/p>","position":"bottom_left"}},"button_iyqzj4":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"Button text","url":"","position":"bottom_left","style":"solid","background":"","text_color":""}}},"block_order":["subheading_yFjxWd","heading_FTwWdL","richtext_TbxKnM","button_iyqzj4"],"name":"t:sections.text_with_media.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-5","content_position":"start","content_percentage_width":50,"overlay_color":"#000000","overlay_opacity":20,"add_media_spacing":false,"autoplay_video":true,"primary_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hojholt_hudpleje_personale_annette.jpg","secondary_media_width":30,"secondary_media_mobile_width":60,"show_secondary_media_on_mobile":true,"secondary_media_alignment":"place-self-end-start","secondary_media_shape":"blob-2"}},"dynamic_grid_qDBqg4":{"type":"dynamic-grid","blocks":{"dynamic_grid_item_mNKcWU":{"type":"_dynamic-grid-item","settings":{"visibility":"both","text_alignment":"left","desktop_row_start":3,"desktop_column_start":4,"desktop_column_end":16,"desktop_horizontal_adjustment":0,"desktop_vertical_adjustment":0,"mobile_row_start":3,"mobile_column_start":2,"mobile_column_end":8,"mobile_horizontal_adjustment":0,"mobile_vertical_adjustment":0,"parallax_speed":4,"parallax_direction":"horizontal"},"blocks":{"dynamic_grid_heading_hteBrR":{"type":"_dynamic-grid-heading","settings":{"text":"Skræddersyet","show_text_vertically":false,"font_size_desktop":5,"font_size_mobile":10,"font_size_line_height":1,"html_tag":"p","indent":"none","highlight_effect":"default","highlight_accent_color":"","highlight_text_color":"#ffffff"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["dynamic_grid_heading_hteBrR"]},"dynamic_grid_item_XDawQx":{"type":"_dynamic-grid-item","settings":{"visibility":"both","text_alignment":"center","desktop_row_start":4,"desktop_column_start":8,"desktop_column_end":10,"desktop_horizontal_adjustment":0,"desktop_vertical_adjustment":3,"mobile_row_start":4,"mobile_column_start":3,"mobile_column_end":6,"mobile_horizontal_adjustment":0,"mobile_vertical_adjustment":3,"parallax_speed":0,"parallax_direction":"vertical"},"blocks":{"rich_text_7YqfE6":{"type":"rich-text","settings":{"text":"<p>pHformula forener medicinsk viden med kosmetisk ekspertise og tilbyder avancerede behandlinger, der skræddersyes til netop din hud – uanset om fokus er sensitiv hud, aldring, pigmentering eller akne.<\/p>","content_width":"xs"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["rich_text_7YqfE6"]},"dynamic_grid_item_9iTNQn":{"type":"_dynamic-grid-item","settings":{"visibility":"both","text_alignment":"center","desktop_row_start":2,"desktop_column_start":6,"desktop_column_end":12,"desktop_horizontal_adjustment":0,"desktop_vertical_adjustment":0,"mobile_row_start":2,"mobile_column_start":3,"mobile_column_end":6,"mobile_horizontal_adjustment":0,"mobile_vertical_adjustment":0,"parallax_speed":0,"parallax_direction":"vertical"},"blocks":{"rich_text_ahhnYC":{"type":"rich-text","settings":{"text":"<p>målrettet hudforbedring<\/p>","content_width":"xs"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["rich_text_ahhnYC"]},"dynamic_grid_item_PaRVBV":{"type":"_dynamic-grid-item","settings":{"visibility":"both","text_alignment":"center","desktop_row_start":8,"desktop_column_start":6,"desktop_column_end":12,"desktop_horizontal_adjustment":0,"desktop_vertical_adjustment":0,"mobile_row_start":9,"mobile_column_start":3,"mobile_column_end":6,"mobile_horizontal_adjustment":0,"mobile_vertical_adjustment":0,"parallax_speed":0,"parallax_direction":"vertical"},"blocks":{"rich_text_73YPAk":{"type":"rich-text","settings":{"text":"<p>resultatorienteret hudpleje<\/p>","content_width":"xs"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["rich_text_73YPAk"]},"dynamic_grid_item_rd896y":{"type":"_dynamic-grid-item","settings":{"visibility":"both","text_alignment":"left","desktop_row_start":6,"desktop_column_start":10,"desktop_column_end":15,"desktop_horizontal_adjustment":0,"desktop_vertical_adjustment":0,"mobile_row_start":7,"mobile_column_start":3,"mobile_column_end":8,"mobile_horizontal_adjustment":0,"mobile_vertical_adjustment":0,"paralla